# IdentityForge — local lab configuration
# Run scripts/setup.sh or scripts/setup.ps1 to generate a private .env.
# These are localhost-only example settings. The admin password below
# is a placeholder; setup generates a unique private password.
# Never commit .env or reuse the generated password elsewhere.

# --- Ports: FIXED for the canonical local lab (P1-14) ----------------------
# 8080 (Keycloak), 8000 (backend), 5173 (frontend) are part of the lab's
# identity: the canonical issuer, redirect URI, Keycloak hostname and
# frontend origin all embed them. Changing only a published port breaks
# login. If a port is already in use, stop the conflicting service (see
# docs/WINDOWS_SETUP.md) — do not change these values.
# (There are intentionally no KEYCLOAK_PORT / BACKEND_PORT /
# FRONTEND_PORT variables: an earlier version offered them, but a
# single-port change silently broke OAuth identity.)

# --- Keycloak bootstrap admin (localhost-only lab admin) --------------------
# Used only to administer the local Keycloak container.
# Docker Compose requires the password from a private .env file.
# The password applies when initializing a new Keycloak data volume.
KEYCLOAK_ADMIN_USERNAME=admin
KEYCLOAK_ADMIN_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME_TO_A_UNIQUE_LOCAL_PASSWORD

# --- Sessions -----------------------------------------------------------
# Sessions are random opaque server-side records (see docs/AUTH_FLOW.md);
# there is NO session-signing secret. An earlier version documented
# IDENTITYFORGE_SESSION_SECRET / SESSION_SECRET, which the code never
# used -- that variable was removed (P1-17). Do not add it back.

# --- OIDC endpoints (do not change unless you change the Compose ports) -----
# Canonical issuer, as seen by the browser and as carried in ID tokens:
IDENTITYFORGE_ISSUER=http://127.0.0.1:8080/realms/identityforge-lab
# Backend transport route to Keycloak (Compose only). The backend fetches
# discovery/token/JWKS via this host, but the issuer identity above is
# never replaced by it (see docs/KEYCLOAK_INTEGRATION.md).
IDENTITYFORGE_IDP_TRANSPORT_BASE=http://keycloak:8080
IDENTITYFORGE_CLIENT_ID=campus-club-portal
IDENTITYFORGE_REDIRECT_URI=http://127.0.0.1:8000/auth/callback
IDENTITYFORGE_FRONTEND_ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:5173

# --- Synthetic test accounts (realm import; localhost-only, NOT real people) -
# Usernames: student_01 (member), officer_01 (member + officer).
# Passwords live ONLY in keycloak/realm-import/identityforge-lab-realm.json
# and are synthetic lab credentials. Rotate them there if you share the lab.
